      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could we add focused test coverage for the transient read-error paths, especially EAGAIN and EINTR, to verify that the inotify watch is re-armed and that fatal read errors still propagate? The implementation looks correct, but these paths are not covered by the current change.",
      "revId": "24411d124b7a5f93b1d736b2fa0ab3a8d8d7f741",
